---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Cookie policy" description={`Which cookies ${SITE.name} uses and how to control them.`}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
    <p class="small muted">Last updated: September 23, 2026</p>
    <p>{SITE.name} itself sets no cookies. Cookies only come from Google's advertising services, and only in the ways you allow.</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Consent</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Google AdSense</td><td>Show and measure ads, limit repeats, prevent fraud</td><td>Asked on your first visit in the EEA, UK and Switzerland</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>You can change your choice at any time from the privacy settings link in the consent message, or delete cookies in your browser.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
